==Latin==

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|la|con|dūcō|t2=lead}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{la-IPA|condūcō}}

===Verb===
{{la-verb|condūcō|condūcere|condūxī|conductum|conj=3|pattern=short-imp}}

# {{lb|la|transitive}} I [[lead]], [[bring]] or [[draw]] together; [[assemble]], [[collect]].
# {{lb|la|transitive}} I [[connect]], [[join]], [[unite]]; [[close up]]; [[coagulate]].
# {{lb|la|transitive}} I [[hire]], [[rent]], [[employ]], take on [[lease]], [[undertake]]; [[farm]]; [[bribe]].
# {{lb|la|intransitive}} I am [[conducive]] to, [[contribute]] to something by being [[useful]], I am of use or [[profitable]], [[serve]].

